{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:AppendixSurrealsArchimedean.EcalleBorelResummation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"AppendixSurrealsArchimedean.EcalleBorelResummation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Factorial.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Cast.Field"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.EcalleBorelResummation.borelCoeff_factorial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.EcalleBorelResummation.borelCoeff_factorial","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals-archimedean/ecalle-borel-resummation.lean#L38-L46","doc":"Normalisation check: the Borel transform flattens the archetypal\nGevrey-1 sequence `aₙ = n!` to the constant sequence `1` — the Borel\ntransform of Euler's factorially divergent series is the geometric\ngerm `1 / (1 - ξ)`, coefficient by coefficient.\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.EcalleBorelResummation.borelCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.EcalleBorelResummation.borelCoeff","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals-archimedean/ecalle-borel-resummation.lean#L27-L36","doc":"The **coefficient-level formal Borel transform**: the sequence of\ncoefficients `a : ℕ → R` of a formal series `Σ aₙ z^{-n-1}` is sent to\nthe coefficient sequence `aₙ / n!` of its Borel transform\n`𝓑f̃(ξ) = Σ aₙ ξⁿ / n!`. This is the exact division that converts\nGevrey-1 (factorial) growth `aₙ = O(n! · A^{-n})` into geometric\ngrowth `O(A^{-n})`, i.e. into a germ analytic on `|ξ| < A`.\n","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:ecalle-borel-resummation","label":"def:ecalle-borel-resummation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals-archimedean/ecalle-borel-resummation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}